<title>DENMARK: Denmark's Codan raises Fokus stake.</title>
<headline>Denmark's Codan raises Fokus stake.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish insurer Codan on Tuesday said that it had increased its share in Norway's Fokus Bank, as it had earlier said it would.</p>
<p>&quot;We bought 3.1 million shares yesterday, raising our total holding to about 8.9 percent,&quot; Deputy General Manager Flemming Kosakewitsch told Reuters.</p>
</text>
